OL,3,GNEWSAMan seriously injured after
OL,4,Aassault in early hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been left with serious
OL,7,Finjuries following an assault in Derby
OL,8,Fin the early hours.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said it was called to
OL,11,FChaddesden following an attack between
OL,12,F12:30 and 01:30 on Sunday.
OL,14,FA police cordon is currently in place
OL,15,Fin Albert Road and Cavan Drive
OL,16,Ffollowing the incident.
OL,18,FThe force is asking for any witnesses,
OL,19,Fand anyone who may have relevant CCTV,
OL,20,Fdoorbell camera or dashcam footage, to
OL,21,Fcome forward.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
